    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "And that finishes Denis's proposal rehearsal. Notice the idiom for a woman getting married—literally 'will you go out behind me'. See you in the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сегодня вечером я сделаю ей предложение!",
